<title>FINLAND: Finnish Nov jobless rate rises to 17.4 percent.</title>
<headline>Finnish Nov jobless rate rises to 17.4 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finland's jobless rate rose to 17.4 percent in November from 17.3 percent in October, the Labour Ministry said in its monthly employment survey on Wednesday.  </p>
<p>			Nov 1996    Oct 1996	Nov 1995</p>
<p>    Unemployed     427,500     424,900	 448,700</p>
<p>    Jobless rate    17.4	  17.3	    18.4</p>
<p>The mean of five economists' forecasts for the November jobless rate measured by the labour ministry was 17.3 percent. The ministry's data is not used in international comparisons.</p>
<p>--Helsinki newsrooom +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
